	select BR2_PACKAGE_ALSA_LIB
	select BR2_PACKAGE_Q2PLAYER_FFMPEG
	select BR2_PACKAGE_Q2_MBEDTLS
	help
	  Vamp's player (player/, docs/player.md), built by player/Makefile as tools/player.py builds it for
